+| reviewer question carrier (AC-4) — audit risk "reviewer question misparsed as interrupted", impact high | a reviewer returns a bare `QUESTION`; the carrier form drifts between template, rule and workflows | static | add (new test `sprint-018 AC-4/AC-5/AC-7: carriers`) | Reviewers are derived from the directory (`asd-reviewer-*` + `asd-external-review`). None lists `QUESTION` under `Signals emitted`. Take the `question:` item form from `t_review.md` `## Escalations` and assert `review-policy.md`'s carrier states that same form. Both review workflows' aggregation steps handle it first and treat it as verdict-bearing, never interrupted |
